{"seq":1,"slug":"channel-preference-quiet-hours-model","title":"通知渠道、用户偏好与静默时段建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/notification-delivery-realtime/channel-preference-quiet-hours-model","wordCount":2810,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"通知渠道-用户偏好与静默时段建模\">通知渠道、用户偏好与静默时段建模</h1><p>触发条件判定通过之后（见 <a href=\"../restock-price-alert-engine/alert-trigger-condition-model\">提醒触发条件建模</a>），一封「到货了」仍未必该发出去：用户可能在东京的凌晨三点、可能关掉了应用推送、也可能五分钟内已收到三条同类通知。渠道选择、偏好表达、静默时段与节流共同构成投递前的最后一道闸门。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>投递决策不是「选一个渠道」的函数，而是对<strong>投递资格</strong>的多轮过滤：同意是否允许 → 渠道是否可达 → 时刻是否落在允许窗口 → 频率预算是否有余额。任何一轮不通过都不是「取消」，而是降级或延迟——这一区别是本文建模的核心。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  T[触发成立&lt;br/&gt;事件已入队] --&gt; C1{同意状态&lt;br/&gt;渠道级 opt-in?}&#10;  C1 --&gt;|未授权| SKIP[抑制&lt;br/&gt;记录原因]&#10;  C1 --&gt;|已授权| C2{渠道可达&lt;br/&gt;token/地址有效?}&#10;  C2 --&gt;|失效| FB[降级到备选渠道]&#10;  C2 --&gt;|有效| C3{静默窗口&lt;br/&gt;当前时刻允许?}&#10;  C3 --&gt;|在静默内| DEF[延迟到窗口开启]&#10;  C3 --&gt;|允许| C4{频率预算&lt;br/&gt;剩余额度?}&#10;  C4 --&gt;|耗尽| HOLD[保留为待发&lt;br/&gt;等次日预算]&#10;  C4 --&gt;|有余| SEND[投递&lt;br/&gt;写投递档案]\">graph TD\n  T[触发成立&lt;br/&gt;事件已入队] --&gt; C1{同意状态&lt;br/&gt;渠道级 opt-in?}\n  C1 --&gt;|未授权| SKIP[抑制&lt;br/&gt;记录原因]\n  C1 --&gt;|已授权| C2{渠道可达&lt;br/&gt;token/地址有效?}\n  C2 --&gt;|失效| FB[降级到备选渠道]\n  C2 --&gt;|有效| C3{静默窗口&lt;br/&gt;当前时刻允许?}\n  C3 --&gt;|在静默内| DEF[延迟到窗口开启]\n  C3 --&gt;|允许| C4{频率预算&lt;br/&gt;剩余额度?}\n  C4 --&gt;|耗尽| HOLD[保留为待发&lt;br/&gt;等次日预算]\n  C4 --&gt;|有余| SEND[投递&lt;br/&gt;写投递档案]</pre><p>关键区分是 <strong>suppress（抑制）</strong> 与 <strong>defer（延迟）</strong>：同意未授权、地址失效属抑制，无论等多久都不该发；静默时段与频率预算属延迟，条件成立只是时机不对。混为一谈是常见缺陷——静默期直接丢弃事件，用户醒来时补货可能已再次售罄；把未授权渠道当成「暂不可达」反复重试，则是在骚扰一个明确说过不要的用户。</p>\n<p>三类触发的时效敏感度不同，决定延迟策略的激进程度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发类型</th>\n<th>时效敏感度</th>\n<th>静默期内策略</th>\n<th>频率预算口径</th>\n<th>典型渠道优先级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存回补</td>\n<td>极高（小时级衰减）</td>\n<td>延迟到窗口开启，且缩短窗口</td>\n<td>按变体+用户计</td>\n<td>推送 &gt; 短信 &gt; 邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降价提醒</td>\n<td>中（促销期内有效）</td>\n<td>延迟，可与次日合并</td>\n<td>按用户计</td>\n<td>推送 &gt; 邮件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标价达成</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>延迟到窗口开启</td>\n<td>按用户计</td>\n<td>推送 &gt; 邮件 &gt; 短信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订阅再确认</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>直接排到允许时段</td>\n<td>不计入</td>\n<td>邮件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第二列决定延迟队列的排序键与过期时间：库存回补类通知应带存活期（例如 6 小时），过期即移出队列并记 <code>EXPIRED_BEFORE_DELIVERY</code>，否则夜间补货会在清晨发一批早已无货的通知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"渠道能力差异与降级链\">渠道能力差异与降级链</h2><p>四个渠道在可达性、延迟、成本与合规上差异极大，选型须基于事实而非直觉。邮件是唯一能承载退订、条款等法律必需信息的渠道，但它的打开率自 Apple 于 2021 年在 iOS 15 推出邮件隐私保护（Mail Privacy Protection）后已被系统性污染——该功能预取远程图片，使「打开」信标在从未阅读时也触发，<strong>用打开率衡量有效性会结构性高估</strong>，应改用点击（来源：<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/mail-privacy-protection/）。\">https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/mail-privacy-protection/）。</a></p>\n<p>推送成本最低、延迟最小，但依赖可变设备令牌，卸载、重装、系统清理都会使其失效。Android 自 API 26（Android 8.0）起要求每条通知归属一个<strong>通知渠道（notification channel）</strong>，用户可按渠道单独开关；「推送开关」因此是按类别的一组开关而非布尔量（来源：<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/channels）。iOS\">https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/channels）。iOS</a> 的<strong>专注模式与定时摘要</strong>会在系统层推迟通知，应用只能通过 <code>interruptionLevel</code> 申请例外（来源：<a href=\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/unnotificationinterruptionlevel）。短信送达率高但成本最高、受最严监管：美国\">https://developer.apple.com/documentation/usernotifications/unnotificationinterruptionlevel）。短信送达率高但成本最高、受最严监管：美国</a> TCPA 下营销短信须有明确书面同意，且通常只能在<strong>当地时间 8:00–21:00</strong> 发送（来源：FCC，<a href=\"https://www.fcc.gov/consumers/guides/stop-unwanted-robocalls-and-texts）。Web\">https://www.fcc.gov/consumers/guides/stop-unwanted-robocalls-and-texts）。Web</a> Push 由 RFC 8030 定义（<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8030），订阅端点同样会失效。\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8030），订阅端点同样会失效。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>渠道</th>\n<th>送达延迟</th>\n<th>单次成本</th>\n<th>同意要求</th>\n<th>令牌失效</th>\n<th>唯一标识</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>应用推送</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>系统授权 + 应用内类别</td>\n<td>高（令牌漂移）</td>\n<td>device token</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>邮件</td>\n<td>秒至分钟</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>多数辖区 opt-out</td>\n<td>低（退信）</td>\n<td>email</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短信</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>多数辖区 opt-in</td>\n<td>中（停机换号）</td>\n<td>E.164 号码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web Push</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>浏览器授权</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>subscription endpoint</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>降级链（fallback chain）应对可达性失败：某渠道令牌失效或回执为永久性失败时，尝试下一优先级渠道。两条硬规则：<strong>降级不跨同意边界</strong>（只授权推送就不能因推送失败改发短信）；<strong>降级要有终止</strong>（全部失败后记 <code>UNDELIVERABLE</code> 并标记待清理）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户偏好与同意状态建模\">用户偏好与同意状态建模</h2><p>偏好不是一张宽表，而是<strong>按渠道、按主题组织的、带来源与时间戳的同意记录</strong>。压成 <code>notify_email boolean</code> 会立刻出问题：无法区分「用户主动关闭」与「默认未开启」，也无法追溯同意来源与版本。正确做法是把同意建模成不可变事件流（默认态仅事务性 → opt-in 营销类别 → 关闭某推送类别 → 恢复 → 全局退订 → 再确认），当前状态是事件的归并投影。</p>\n<p>合规上有一条贯穿所有辖区的原则：<strong>事务性通知与营销性通知必须分开建模</strong>。「你订阅的商品到货了」在多数解释下属用户请求的事务性消息，「猜你喜欢」属营销。欧盟 GDPR 与 ePrivacy 指令要求营销电子通信基于自由给出、具体、知情、明确的同意（来源：GDPR 第 4(11) 条；ePrivacy 指令 2002/58/EC 第 13 条；司法立场见 CJEU C-673/17 Planet49 判决）。美国 CAN-SPAM 要求商业邮件提供可用退订且在 10 个工作日内生效（来源：<a href=\"https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business）。退订实现亦有标准：Gmail\">https://www.ftc.gov/business-guidance/resources/can-spam-act-compliance-guide-business）。退订实现亦有标准：Gmail</a> 与 Yahoo 自 2024 年 2 月起要求大批量发送者（日发超 5000 封）实现 <strong>RFC 8058 一键退订</strong>、通过 SPF/DKIM 认证、配置 DMARC，投诉率须低于 0.3%（来源：<a href=\"https://support.google.com/a/answer/81126；https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8058）。\">https://support.google.com/a/answer/81126；https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8058）。</a></p>\n<p>偏好模型还应记录<strong>来源</strong>与<strong>生效时间</strong>以解决冲突：用户在网页端关了营销推送，却在移动端被默认重新开启。归并规则是「显式优先于默认、最近优先、更具体优先」：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>effective</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>latest</mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>global</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>channel</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>topic</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{effective}(u, c, k) = \\text{latest}\\bigl(\\; \\text{global}(u),\\; \\text{channel}(u,c),\\; \\text{topic}(u,c,k) \\;\\bigr)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">effective</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latest</span></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">global</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">channel</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">topic</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 是用户、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 是渠道、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是通知类别，<code>latest</code> 取该层级最近一次显式事件。实现时必须把「更具体」与「最近」两个排序键都写进归并函数，否则会出现渠道级设置被更早的全局设置覆盖的缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静默时段与时区建模\">静默时段与时区建模</h2><p>静默时段（quiet hours）建模难点全在<strong>时区</strong>：用户的静默窗口是当地时间 22:00–08:00，而存储层时间戳应是带偏移的绝对时间。把「22:00」当成服务器本地时间或 UTC 存储都会错——用户在欧洲、服务器在美西、UTC 是三个时区，三者的 22:00 相差数小时。正确做法是把窗口存成<strong>用户时区的本地时刻</strong>、事件时刻存 UTC，判定时按 IANA 时区标识实时换算；时区数据随立法变动（夏令时、政治性调整），必须用持续更新的 IANA tzdb 而非手写偏移表（来源：<a href=\"https://www.iana.org/time-zones）。\">https://www.iana.org/time-zones）。</a></p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[事件 UTC 时刻] --&gt; B[解析用户 IANA 时区]&#10;  B --&gt; C[换算为当地时刻]&#10;  C --&gt; D{落在静默窗口内?}&#10;  D --&gt;|否| E[允许投递]&#10;  D --&gt;|是| F{触发类别可延迟?}&#10;  F --&gt;|可延迟| G[计算窗口开启的 UTC 时刻&lt;br/&gt;入延迟队列]&#10;  F --&gt;|紧急例外| H[检查例外策略]&#10;  H --&gt;|符合| E&#10;  H --&gt;|不符合| G\">graph TD\n  A[事件 UTC 时刻] --&gt; B[解析用户 IANA 时区]\n  B --&gt; C[换算为当地时刻]\n  C --&gt; D{落在静默窗口内?}\n  D --&gt;|否| E[允许投递]\n  D --&gt;|是| F{触发类别可延迟?}\n  F --&gt;|可延迟| G[计算窗口开启的 UTC 时刻&lt;br/&gt;入延迟队列]\n  F --&gt;|紧急例外| H[检查例外策略]\n  H --&gt;|符合| E\n  H --&gt;|不符合| G</pre><p>时区带来两个必须显式处理的边界。其一是<strong>无效时刻与重复时刻</strong>：夏令时切换当天某些当地时刻不存在（前跳）或出现两次（回拨），窗口开启时刻若落在其中，换算会抛错或静默偏移——应把「窗口开启瞬间」收敛到一个确定规则并测试两个切换日。其二是<strong>时区未知</strong>：用户从未提供时区时不应默认按 UTC（那等于平移静默窗口），应退回保守策略（仅保留事务性渠道）；用 IP 定位推断时区跨 VPN 与旅行会误判，只能作为<strong>待确认推断值</strong>。紧急例外（interruption level）是静默的合法出口但边界必须窄：「商品到货了」不构成打断夜间休息的理由，例外应限于经独立显式同意的事件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"频率预算-疲劳与投递节流\">频率预算、疲劳与投递节流</h2><p>即便每一封单独看都合规，叠加仍可能构成骚扰。频率控制有三个正交维度，必须都建模：<strong>用户级每日上限</strong>、<strong>同类通知冷却时间</strong>、<strong>跨订阅合并窗口</strong>。任何缺失都留漏洞——只做用户级上限，用户当天会收到三条同类通知；只做同订阅冷却，订阅了大量商品的用户会被自己的订阅淹没。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>allow</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>sent</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>day</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>daily</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>cool</mtext></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>∧</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mtext> </mtext><mtext>within_merge_window</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{allow}(u, t) = \\bigl[\\, n_{\\text{sent}}(u, \\text{day}) &lt; B_{\\text{daily}}\\,\\bigr] \\;\\land\\; \\bigl[\\, t - t_{\\text{last}}(u, k) \\ge \\tau_{\\text{cool}}\\,\\bigr] \\;\\land\\; \\bigl[\\, \\text{within\\_merge\\_window}(t) \\,\\bigr]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">allow</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">sent</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">day</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">daily</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cool</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">within_merge_window</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mtext>daily</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_{\\text{daily}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">daily</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是当日发送预算，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mtext>cool</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau_{\\text{cool}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1132em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cool</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是同类通知冷却时间，合并窗口把同一时段内多个成立的触发收敛成一封。预算应<strong>按渠道分别计算</strong>——共用预算会导致邮件额度被推送耗尽这类错误。预算之外的软约束是<strong>疲劳度</strong>：用户连续多次收到通知却未点击时，提升其后续阈值或降低渠道优先级，比单纯提高发送量更健康。</p>\n<p>节流还要处理<strong>大促的放大效应</strong>：购物节期间同时成立的触发数量可能比平日高出一到两个数量级，不做全局限流则投递系统自身成为瓶颈并拖垮延迟队列。工程上应把队列按优先级分桶（事务性 &gt; 即时类 &gt; 批量回补类），拥塞时优先丢弃或推迟最低优先级桶而非 FIFO 排队。所有投递决策还应写下<strong>可审计的投递档案</strong>（是否发送、走哪个渠道、被抑制或延迟的原因），这既是排查「用户说没收到」的唯一依据，也是合规证明。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>每轮过滤任一轮不通过都不是「取消」，而是降级或延迟，要严格区分 <strong>suppress（永久不发）</strong> 与 <strong>defer（稍后再发）</strong>，混同会导致误发骚扰或误弃有效通知。</li>\n<li>四渠道差异显著：邮件打开率因 Apple Mail Privacy Protection 的图片预取而系统性高估（来源：<a href=\"https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/mail-privacy-protection/）；推送开关在\">https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/data/en/mail-privacy-protection/）；推送开关在</a> Android 自 API 26 起按<strong>通知渠道</strong>分类控制（来源：<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/channels），iOS\">https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/notifications/channels），iOS</a> 专注模式与定时摘要会在系统层推迟展示；短信受 TCPA 约束，营销短信通常限于当地时间 8:00–21:00（来源：<a href=\"https://www.fcc.gov/consumers/guides/stop-unwanted-robocalls-and-texts）。\">https://www.fcc.gov/consumers/guides/stop-unwanted-robocalls-and-texts）。</a></li>\n<li>偏好按「渠道 × 类别」建模为带来源与时间戳的<strong>不可变同意事件流</strong>，用「更具体 + 最近」归并；事务性与营销性须分开授权，大批量邮件发送者须实现 RFC 8058 一键退订并通过认证。</li>\n<li>静默时段存<strong>用户本地时刻</strong>、事件存 <strong>UTC</strong>，换算依赖持续更新的 IANA tzdb（来源：<a href=\"https://www.iana.org/time-zones），并显式处理夏令时的不存在与重复时刻。\">https://www.iana.org/time-zones），并显式处理夏令时的不存在与重复时刻。</a></li>\n<li>频率控制要三层齐备（用户级预算 / 同类冷却 / 合并窗口），预算按渠道分开，并为大促放大预设优先级分桶。</li>\n<li>订阅判定见 <a href=\"../restock-price-alert-engine/alert-trigger-condition-model\">提醒触发条件建模</a>，收藏实体建模见 <a href=\"../wishlist-entity-catalog-model/\">心愿单实体与商品收藏建模</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"通知渠道、用户偏好与静默时段建模","id":"通知渠道-用户偏好与静默时段建模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"渠道能力差异与降级链","id":"渠道能力差异与降级链"},{"level":2,"text":"用户偏好与同意状态建模","id":"用户偏好与同意状态建模"},{"level":2,"text":"静默时段与时区建模","id":"静默时段与时区建模"},{"level":2,"text":"频率预算、疲劳与投递节流","id":"频率预算-疲劳与投递节流"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"到货通知的库存竞争、超卖与虚假回补异常处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/restock-price-alert-engine/backinstock-oversell-false-alarm"},"next":{"title":"提醒投递管道：幂等、去重、重试与实时性保障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/wishlist-restock-price-alert-engagement/notification-delivery-realtime/alert-delivery-pipeline-idempotency"}}